  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Ball 1 collides with an initially stationary ball 2 of the same mass. After the collision, the balls move with speeds <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{2}\"></span>. Their velocities make angles <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta_{2}\"></span> with the original direction of motion of ball 1.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v_{1}}{v_{2}}\"></span></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{sin \\theta_{2}}{sin \\theta_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{sin \\theta_{1}}{sin \\theta_{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{cos \\theta_{2}}{cos \\theta_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{cos \\theta_{1}}{cos \\theta_{2}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
